>> title: Rice Krispie Treats
>> category: Bars & Brownies
>> tags: marshmallow, cereal, no-bake, dessert, kids
>> servings: 12
>> time: 20 min
>> step.3: stir in until smooth
>> step.6: press into the pan and cool

Butter a #9x13-in pan{} and a spatula.

Melt @unsalted butter{3%Tbs}(42 g) in a #large saucepan{} over low heat.

Stir @mini marshmallows{10%oz}(280 g), @table salt{1/4%tsp}(1.5 g) into @&(~1)melted butter{} until smooth.

Stir @&(~1)marshmallow cream{} with @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL).

Fold @&(~1)marshmallow mixture{} with @toasted rice cereal{6%cup}(170 g).

Press @&(~1)cereal mixture{} into the pan with the buttered spatula.
